10.5px] leading-tight text-muted/70\">非證券投資顧問事業<span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">｜公開資料研究與教學，不提供個股分析意見或推介</span><span class=\"sm:hidden\">｜公開資料研究與教學</span> <a class=\"underline underline-offset-2\" href=\"/legal\">法遵</a> · <a class=\"underline underline-offset-2\" href=\"/privacy\">隱私</a></div><header class=\"Navigation_header__9xJIy\"><div class=\"Navigation_inner__HaQCh\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Navigation_backBtn__rNB5u\" aria-label=\"返回上一頁\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M228,128a12,12,0,0,1-12,12H69l51.52,51.51a12,12,0,0,1-17,17l-72-72a12,12,0,0,1,0-17l72-72a12,12,0,0,1,17,17L69,116H216A12,12,0,0,1,228,128Z\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"Navigation_brand__V_MfK\" aria-label=\"回股市大佬首頁\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/brand/tradeboss-logo.png\" alt=\"股市大佬 TradeBoss\" class=\"Navigation_logoImg___eeKZ\"/><span class=\"Navigation_brandText__c1Rib\"><span class=\"Navigation_brandTitle__V8fwH\">股市<span class=\"Navigation_brandAccent__bb15A\">大佬</span></span><span class=\"Navigation_brandSub__XUkO_\">TRADEBOSS</span></span></a><nav class=\"Navigation_nav__D1U__\"><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/learn\">文章</a><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/school\">學堂</a><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/about\">關於</a><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/login\">登入</a></nav><div class=\"Navigation_actions__QSJSs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Navigation_themeBtn__I9ble\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"切換到淺色（較亮、較清楚）\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"Navigation_themeGlyph__wvU6O\">☀</span><span class=\"Navigation_srOnly__lixg9\">切換淺色</span></button><a class=\"Navigation_loginMobile__J3HwV\" href=\"/login\">登入</a></div></div></header><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"StaticPage_page__Pk04n\"><div class=\"StaticPage_enter__wb_uk\"><section class=\"StaticPage_hero__awFjR\"><h1 class=\"StaticPage_heroTitle__5tyIo\">股市大佬 App 安裝</h1><p class=\"StaticPage_heroLead__TNPFm\">iPhone／iPad 正式版已在 App Store 上架。整合個股資料、台股日報、AI 教學問答與歷史行情練習，使用原本的網站帳號即可登入。</p><div class=\"StaticPage_heroCtas__54QbZ\"><a class=\"StaticPage_ctaPrimary__4x_E8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/tw/app/id6796674804\">前往 App Store 免費下載</a></div></section><section class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">Android／電腦用戶</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">用手機瀏覽器打開 blackstockai.com，依系統提示「加入主畫面」。 網站與 App 用同一組 Email。這是網站捷徑，不是 Google Play 安裝；教學見使用手冊。</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/diary\">查看加入主畫面教學</a></div></div></section><section class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">iPhone／iPad 安裝方式</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/tw/app/id6796674804\">開啟 App Store</a></div></div></section><section class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">Android</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">這是直接安裝的測試檔，不是 Google Play 正式版。 請確認下載網址是 expo.dev。測試檔會不定期換新， 若下載失敗請改用上面的「加入主畫面」。 iPhone／iPad 請改用本頁上方的 App Store 正式版。</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://expo.dev/artifacts/eas/qa948di5fqXksZe9eK6Wm6FLO52wgCiC7gNMcm-4MC4.apk\">下載 Android APK</a></div></div></section><section class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">不想安裝測試版</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">網站與 App 使用相同帳號、相同資料。手機瀏覽器可把股市大佬加入主畫面， iPhone／iPad 也可直接安裝本頁上方的正式商店版。</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/\">回股市大佬</a></div><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">新使用者註冊時推薦碼是選填；沒有推薦碼可按「我沒有推薦碼，直接註冊」。 App 安裝本身也不需要網站推薦碼。</p></div></section></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer mx-auto mt-14 w-full max-w-[1360px] px-4 md:px-6\"><div class=\"data-panel rounded-2xl border border-line/80 bg-surface/70 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\"><p class=\"mb-1.5 font-bold text-ink\">免責與法遵聲明</p><p>本平台提供台股公開籌碼資料之統計、教學與研究工具，所有數字均為歷史資料整理，<span class=\"font-bold text-ink\">不構成任何投資建議、招攬、買賣要約或獲利保證</span>。平台不代客操作、不提供個股買賣訊號、不保證準確性。 投資有風險，交易前請自行評估、獨立判斷並自負盈虧。 本站不會私訊要驗證碼或叫你匯款。</p><nav aria-label=\"公司資訊與法遵\" class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2 text-[12.5px] font-bold mt-3\"><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/about\">關於本站</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/guide\">新手導覽</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/privacy\">隱私權政策</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/terms\">服務條款</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/legal\">法遵說明</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/member/?tab=feedback\">使用回饋／刪帳</a></nav></div><p class=\"mt-3 pb-2 text-center text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-muted\">股市大佬 TradeBoss · © 2026 資料研究工具｜非投資建議</p></footer><nav aria-label=\"手機導覽（未登入）\" class=\"mobile-taskbar fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-30 grid h-[calc(4.5rem+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] grid-cols-5 border-t border-line bg-surface/96 pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)] backdrop-blur-xl lg:hidden\"><a class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 text-[11px] font-black transition active:scale-95 text-muted\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"grid place-items-center rounded-full transition-all duration-200 h-7 w-10 text-current\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M222.14,105.85l-80-80a20,20,0,0,0-28.28,0l-80,80A19.86,19.86,0,0,0,28,120v96a12,12,0,0,0,12,12h64a12,12,0,0,0,12-12V164h24v52a12,12,0,0,0,12,12h64a12,12,0,0,0,12-12V120A19.86,19.86,0,0,0,222.14,105.85ZM204,204H164V152a12,12,0,0,0-12-12H104a12,12,0,0,0-12,12v52H52V121.65l76-76,76,76Z\"></path></svg></span><span>首頁</span></a><a class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 text-[11px] font-black transition active:scale-95 text-muted\" href=\"/learn\"><span class=\"grid place-items-center rounded-full transition-all duration-200 h-7 w-10 text-current\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M92,108a12,12,0,0,1,12-12h72a12,12,0,0,1,0,24H104A12,